    "name": "Hidden Cats - Christmas",
    "steam_appid": 3366410,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366410/extras/7c3fbe3ba018a19f920f69af4d047751.avif?t=1734644033\" width=616 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the enchanting world of &quot;Hidden Cats - Christmas&quot; a hidden object game where your mission is to uncover every cat hidden within stunning hand-painted artwork. Let your keen eye and curiosity guide you through this captivating journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3a 100 Hidden Cats: Discover 100 hidden cats scattered throughout the artwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Unlimited Hints: Stuck? Use unlimited hints to find the hidden cats and keep progressing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Custom Music: Enjoy unique background music for the artwork, enhancing your immersion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 Timer: Keep track of how long you take to complete the level with an in-game timer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc5 Leaderboard: Track your best times and challenge yourself to beat them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the scenes using your mouse to drag and move, and zoom in/out with your mouse wheel. Click on any cat you find to collect it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Accessibility Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Mode for comfortable viewing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us in &quot;Hidden Cats - Christmas&quot; and indulge in the perfect blend of challenge, charm, and discovery. Will you find all the hidden cats? Let the hunt begin!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366410/extras/7c3fbe3ba018a19f920f69af4d047751.avif?t=1734644033\" width=616 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the enchanting world of &quot;Hidden Cats - Christmas&quot; a hidden object game where your mission is to uncover every cat hidden within stunning hand-painted artwork. Let your keen eye and curiosity guide you through this captivating journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3a 100 Hidden Cats: Discover 100 hidden cats scattered throughout the artwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Unlimited Hints: Stuck? Use unlimited hints to find the hidden cats and keep progressing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Custom Music: Enjoy unique background music for the artwork, enhancing your immersion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 Timer: Keep track of how long you take to complete the level with an in-game timer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc5 Leaderboard: Track your best times and challenge yourself to beat them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the scenes using your mouse to drag and move, and zoom in/out with your mouse wheel. Click on any cat you find to collect it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Accessibility Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Mode for comfortable viewing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us in &quot;Hidden Cats - Christmas&quot; and indulge in the perfect blend of challenge, charm, and discovery. Will you find all the hidden cats? Let the hunt begin!</p>",
